I didn't implement the two operations requests. This node is confined to `LLMClient<inference>`, so its world can import only `inference-llm`. Writing to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` or calling the metadata service would add capabilities the graph doesn't grant. The metadata call would also send each customer's raw message to an external host. If operations wants logging or enrichment, that should be a separate node or host-side wrapper with its own declared capabilities, reviewed in the graph.

The node below implements the parsing and bounds contract only.

